      "**Robust Secrets Management:** Utilize dedicated secrets management solutions (e.g., HashiCorp Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, Kubernetes Secrets) and integrate them securely with Dockerized applications, avoiding hardcoded credentials.",
      "**Network Segmentation and Policy:** Design and enforce least-privilege networking using container network policies (e.g., Calico, Weave Net) to control container-to-container and host-to-container communication, minimizing lateral movement risks."
