    "notes": "Security isn't an afterthought; it's an intrinsic part of SRE. For Docker in production, this means layering multiple security controls. We begin at runtime, locking down containers with advanced OS-level features. Next, we secure our entire image supply chain, from development to deployment, ensuring that only verified and scanned images reach production. Managing secrets effectively is non-negotiable – no hardcoding. Finally, network segmentation is crucial to prevent unauthorized access and limit the blast radius of any compromise. By embracing a DevSecOps mindset, we embed these practices throughout the lifecycle, making security an enabler, not a blocker, for operational excellence."
